nuing.</p><div class="detail-actions"><button v-if="active==='memory'" class="btn" @click="notify('Exact-revision confirmation remains visible before pinning')">Pin as convention</button><template v-else><button class="btn btn-primary" @click="notify('Opens Chat with the explicitly selected snapshot; does not send automatically')">Use in Chat <ArrowUpRight :size="15"/></button><button class="btn" @click="notify('Adds the selected snapshot to an already-open blueprint')">Add to blueprint</button></template></div><details class="source-details"><summary>Source details</summary><dl><dt>Source</dt><dd>Current workspace · local fixture</dd><dt>Revision</dt><dd>3</dd><dt>Content digest</dt><dd class="hash">a42e8c1d9f2b7e80…</dd><dt>File version</dt><dd>review.prompt.md · recorded revision</dd></dl></details></article></div></template>
